e","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"15"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"My little dove has brought me an olive leaf! It's now my turn to take care of the rest.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A blind, wheelchair-bound girl born into royalty in a country in northern Europe. Though she's tall and wise beyond her years, she's still in her teens. She moved to Japan, where her grandmother is from, in order to get away from her overprotective family. Rationality and efficiency are her mottos. With her long, silver hair, she possesses the beauty of a snow fairy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has an incredible talent for painting, and it's said that her paintings are able to change the world for anyone who sees them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c135552"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/37e3a377f80771677253df18ac1d1891ae5ce39d78a8a7265a28ff5eb1ed2d92.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/538b25635b62c9c6251daefb02da9f78663aa58e32955d295890fa22ac808299.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高柳 知葉","creatorId":"vndb:s15917","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15917","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15917","name":"高柳 知葉","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96949","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c135553","characterName":"空木 夏夏","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c135553"},"originalCharacterName":"空木 夏夏","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Your paintings are truly incredible, Lilja-san. They have the power to change the world of anybody who sees them.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An energetic girl who works as a live-in assistant for Lilja. She dedicates her days to being Lilja's new eyes and legs and bringing inspiration to the painter, who is blind and can't walk. Her short stature and youthful looks make it easy to mistake her for an elementary schooler, but she's actually a full-grown adult. She tends to make decisions based on intuition and wild instinct alone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's strong, stubborn, and has a healthy appetite."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c135553"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e3360e83b9976fa74b6cc057cc0a6a49e3cdf063f06e346f2bf20564360faf98.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/40/407f385d32a4534b11676416d5c7e3aad892be7d60676c1c577059121ce5dde9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"伊駒 ゆりえ","creatorId":"vndb:s36616","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s36616","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s36616","name":"伊駒 ゆりえ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96956","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c136918","characterName":"佐々波 まひる","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c136918"},"originalCharacterName":"佐々波 まひる","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I admit that I'm not a 24-hour security system, since I have to sleep at some point. But I try to keep an eye out seven days a week, anytime, anywhere.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A shut-in whose hobbies include e-commerce, video games, and celebrity gossip."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She works as a security guard at Lilja's condominium to guarantee Lilja's safety while she lives alone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her room is filled to the brim with all sorts of goods, but she doesn't seem to mind the mess."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When Lilja offered her a bonus, Mahiru requested that Lilja paint a picture of a monster that can make even eternal love grow cold."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c136918"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c01edd56e841cc9f46149941d499dbc1b641db6d47f6570d0df4fe6ea9478ed9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3fa876680f911729cc1941f7a8b41911a8d6b3a673238357e412e601a2b7a386.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田中 貴子","creatorId":"vndb:s29188","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s29188","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s29188","name":"田中 貴子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96953","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c136919","characterName":"透月 夜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c136919"},"originalCharacterName":"透月 夜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Fame brings nothing good with it. You get a bunch of things you never really wanted, and you lose everything you did want...\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An up-and-coming actress and model who primarily works in Europe."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a breathtaking beauty with a sharp gaze that always seems to be filled with anger."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has returned to Japan to promote her new movie."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c136919"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1e/1e074f768121c69e322ccc5a003ea6f703e68e117b54ccc3ef9e1331c2c893c8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c55ddfd116692d22a83274eee5b261addc2423c1a5917560b7dd4023423b8739.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大久保 瑠美","creatorId":"vndb:s3413","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3413","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3413","name":"大久保 瑠美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96946","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c137480","characterName":"春日衣 優","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c137480"},"originalCharacterName":"春日衣 優","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Memories are strange things, aren't they? When I think back to the fun times I had in school, my weary heart warms up, and it gives me the energy to keep going.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A kind, gentle lady who works for a confectionery manufacturer in Tokyo."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yuu has a laid-back attitude and enjoys baking sweets."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She especially loves visiting cafes and bakeries with her friend Takano, and her social media"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"feed is chock-full of beautiful pictures."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is getting married soon, and she requests a painting of the train station from her high school days to decorate the new apartment she'll be sharing with her partner."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c137480"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a815f4cb0659e4ccb86d46c09e67c8c661cff262992d4d36b481a66fedf00dbe.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b76e003f93ba08c4d122442f019cc5ff0c588813947f31c52bdb43fd9d79e46e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田中 美海","creatorId":"vndb:s8115","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8115","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8115","name":"田中 美海","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96947","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c137668","characterName":"羽ヶ崎 真璃子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c137668"},"originalCharacterName":"羽ヶ崎 真璃子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I'm sure we're going to be happy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Father and Mother, and now Yoshino, too, are watching over us from heaven."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"We have to move on with our lives and be happy.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The eldest daughter of the long-standing, noble Hanegasaki family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a dignified lady who charms people with her elegant looks and her open-minded and refined demeanor."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She and her twin sister, Miyako, have been together with their childhood friend Yoshino since"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"they were born."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She loves to dote on her younger twin sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c137668"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c06ae73c2e84691da5afcd5aa1976473d540e9a34b5408e964de2ffac812fed5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6d/6ddc9e7969492e92f49423aa00396e321bff48562cbe61b92e086da33d8d0c77.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"古賀 葵","creatorId":"vndb:s25764","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s25764","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s25764","name":"古賀葵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96951","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c137669","characterName":"白縫 りら","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c137669"},"originalCharacterName":"白縫 りら","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I want to know... I need to know.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The caretaker of the storehouse where the Meri family's paintings are stored."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a somber, elderly woman who's often seen wearing a classic black dress and lives a quiet life by herself in the living quarters attached to the storehouse."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c137669"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2c0c7d5a43569cfb6044aa126ad40b087d3a76ed7d477d1673f7b509f8c28938.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/06/06781936d86b4d89aef3b9836c8ed4681c7e7bf7a3e8830fd7a18d145ff39cba.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"神田 みか","creatorId":"vndb:s35868","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s35868","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s35868","name":"神田 みか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96954","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c137670","characterName":"イヌイ・サーリヤルヴィ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c137670"},"originalCharacterName":"イヌイ・サーリヤルヴィ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"It's my job to provide Lilja-sama with the information she needs.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An extremely capable detective and researcher who works at the Japanese branch of the detective agency \"Antero Research,\" which has deep ties to the royal family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a mature woman who seems to have a permanent smile and is always one or two steps ahead of her clients."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Whatever they need, she will procure it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c137670"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5ca5ed1b18ff4d8d7f382fa11bc98315ebc1213ef1077e5c841bf58a640c8348.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a9b4bb715eb77e2a79472577814d45e561222107b5249640639fcfc883300a20.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"青山 吉能","creatorId":"vndb:s36306","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s36306","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s36306","name":"青山吉能","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96955","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c142259","characterName":"羽ヶ崎 美彌子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c142259"},"originalCharacterName":"羽ヶ崎 美彌子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The younger Hanegasaki twin is an introverted and shy girl who can normally be found hiding behind her older sister. Humble and kind, she evokes in others the desire to protect her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's still in shock after losing her childhood friend in the car accident that she managed to survive."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has since confined herself to her room while she recovers from her injuries."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c142259"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2cda0c51495146f761f2f0aac192a4291cd82dee288d9cc7e02fc3142cfeadfa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f7/f7169f3f703216eb39dc96fb623645dac4263a738ac8ad26a3b093c50fe7d1bd.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"稗田 寧々","creatorId":"vndb:s25772","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s25772","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s25772","name":"稗田 寧々","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96952","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c142260","characterName":"久住 善乃","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c142260"},"originalCharacterName":"久住 善乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A heroic, gallant girl and the eldest daughter of the Kuzumi family, which has served the Hanegasaki family as doctors for generations."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is extremely loyal and often protected the twins like a knight."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her excellent grades, athletic skills, and great reputation have earned her tons of popularity among the other students at school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, she died in a traffic accident while protecting Miyako."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c142260"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0c6f715c81fc61332f335ad5e60692802ff0dfe56bbe74b177415e22931be2d3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fec7bc25f8644180cd6deab0bc94dd655a9ab09624d2f70bc56dc828866a4176.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"原 紗友里","creatorId":"vndb:s9716","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s9716","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9716","name":"原紗友里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96948","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c142261","characterName":"鷹野 晶","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c142261"},"originalCharacterName":"鷹野 晶","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A calm, confident, and dependable woman who works at a jewelry company in Tokyo."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a close friend of Yuu's."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The two often go out together, and they can talk to each other about almost anything."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c142261"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/72/72f61c83b1976339b0a9bdfc0434b8a63e05af53bd8ec2e422bec3450b8